{"id": 28, "ts": 1780461876.9372554, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate James confirming that we have no data on Candidate\u202fA\u2019s reliability in long\u2011haul operations or on how A handles stress or unexpected events. That leaves A with strong situational awareness and leadership, but without any evidence for the core safety criteria we need for international flights. Compared with the other alternatives, Candidate\u202fB\u2019s uncooperative tendency and Candidate\u202fD\u2019s hot\u2011tempered reputation also raise serious crew\u2011cooperation concerns, and we still lack concrete decision\u2011quality examples for both. Although Candidate\u202fC\u2019s reliability claim lacks long\u2011haul specifics and his communication difficulty is a risk, the only concrete safety\u2011relevant evidence we have for C is a 100\u202f% reliability record (albeit not flight\u2011type specific) and a proven ability to make correct decisions quickly, plus a positive crew atmosphere. Given that the other three candidates each have missing or negative evidence on critical criteria, I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is the strongest overall fit for the long\u2011distance pilot role."}
